# The plan snapshot test feeds deliberately unsafe locators and a private marker to prove the
# projection strips credentials, query strings and fragments. The unsafe values are the input.
secret-assignment internal/appworkflow/hoststate/plan_snapshot_test.go test input for a redaction test, not a real secret
credentials-in-url internal/appworkflow/hoststate/plan_snapshot_test.go test input for a redaction test, not a real URL
#
